ready1_open_rewrite.raw_answer_text:
Solution: From the problem statement, we have
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
c=0\\
-16+4b+c=0
\end{array}
\right.
\]
Solving this, we get
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
b=4\\
c=0
\end{array}
\right.
\]
$\therefore$ The quadratic function is: \boxed{y=-x^{2}+4x}.

